    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"One-to-one programme\",\"title\":\"Circumcision training for doctors\",\"lede\":\"We provide training for doctors who want to develop their knowledge and skills in male circumcision. The course combines theory with observation of clinical practice and is designed to cover circumcision across different age groups.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"For doctors\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One-to-one programme. Training topics include relevant anatomy, indications and contraindications, the Plastibell / ring method, the forceps-guided method, instruments and equipment, suturing and wound closure, aftercare and complications, therapeutic circumcision and phimosis, frenulum procedures, re-circumcision, buried penis considerations, and practice setup, documents and suppliers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The existing course information also lists a certificate of completion, handouts, observation of live procedures, opportunities to assist where appropriate, and ongoing communication/support.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/spec-panel {\"eyebrow\":\"The course\",\"rows\":[{\"k\":\"Format\",\"v\":\"One to one\"},{\"k\":\"Theory\",\"v\":\"Combined with observation of clinical practice\"},{\"k\":\"Live procedures\",\"v\":\"Observation, with opportunities to assist where appropriate\"},{\"k\":\"Methods\",\"v\":\"Plastibell / ring and forceps-guided\"},{\"k\":\"Ages covered\",\"v\":\"Different age groups\"},{\"k\":\"Certificate\",\"v\":\"Certificate of completion\"},{\"k\":\"After the course\",\"v\":\"Ongoing communication and support\"}],\"note\":\"\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Syllabus\",\"heading\":\"Training topics\",\"lede\":\"The course is designed to cover circumcision across different age groups.\",\"display\":\"d-1\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Fundamentals\",\"html\":\"\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eAnatomy\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eIndications for circumcision\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eContra-indications\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Plastibell (ring) method\",\"html\":\"\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eInstruments needed\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eHow to use the device\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eAftercare\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eDealing with complications\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Forceps guided method\",\"html\":\"\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eInstruments needed\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003ePerforming the circumcision\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eSuturing\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eAftercare and complications\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Therapeutic circumcision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eDealing with phimosis\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003ePreventing recurrence\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eFrenulum removal\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Harder cases\",\"html\":\"\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eRe-circumcisions, free hand method\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/buried-penis/\\u0022\\u003eBuried penis\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Setting up\",\"html\":\"\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eHow to set up your practice\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eList of all suppliers\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eConsent forms and essential documents\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps eyebrow\\u0022\\u003eIncluded\\u003c/span\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"display d-1\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-1\">What the course covers</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Certificate of completion</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Handouts</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Observation of live procedures</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Opportunities to assist where appropriate</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Ongoing communication and support</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022tel:+442089513794\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022call-courses\\u0022\\u003eCall 020 8951 3794\\u003c/a\\u003e\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Course enquiry\",\"title\":\"Ask about dates\",\"formId\":\"courses\",\"subject\":\"training course enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->"
